@startuml seq-03-zero-trust-sbi-tls
title Phase 2 — SBI TLS (SEC-01): No Certificate → Handshake Rejection

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
autonumber

participant "UERANSIM gNB\n127.0.0.1:38412" as GNB
participant "AMF\nfree5gc-amf" as AMF
participant "NRF\nfree5gc-nrf\n:19001" as NRF
participant "SMF\nfree5gc-smf\n:19003" as SMF
participant "Platform\nPrometheus\n:9090" as Prom
participant "Grafana D5\n:3000" as Grafana

note over AMF, SMF : SBI TLS enabled\n(scheme: https in amfcfg.yaml)\nEach NF has PEM cert from Platform PKI

== Normal flow (cert present) ==

GNB -> AMF : NGAP N2 Registration Request\n(SCTP :38412)
AMF -> NRF : HTTPS POST /nnrf-nfm/v1/nf-instances/{amfId}\n(TLS — AMF presents amf.pem to NRF)
NRF --> AMF : 201 NFProfile registered

AMF -> SMF : HTTPS POST /nsmf-pdusession/v1/sm-contexts\n(TLS mTLS — AMF presents cert, verifies SMF cert)
SMF --> AMF : 201 smContextRef

== SEC-01 Demo: AMF starts WITHOUT certificate ==

note over AMF : amfcfg.yaml: tls.pem missing\nor self-signed not in NRF trust store

AMF -> NRF : HTTPS POST /nnrf-nfm/v1/nf-instances/{amfId}\n(TLS handshake — no client cert)
NRF --> AMF : TLS alert: certificate_required (42)\nor handshake_failure

AMF -> SMF : HTTPS POST /nsmf-pdusession/…\n(TLS handshake — AMF cert rejected)
SMF --> AMF : TLS ALERT: bad_certificate (42)

note over AMF : Registration fails\nPDU session cannot be established

AMF -> Prom : scrape /metrics → sbi_tls_handshake_failures_total{nf="amf"} ++
Prom -> Grafana : query → D5 panel "SBI TLS Failures" alerts

@enduml
